  year      = {1985},
  volume    = {112},
  number    = {4},
  pages     = {799--818},
  month     = feb,
  abstract  = {A general matrix equation for evolutionary equilibrium of sex allocation is derived. The equation allows calculation of ESS values of behavioural parameters in sex allocation models, and provides a conceptual framework in which such models can be viewed. A careful discussion is given of a number of examples from the literature. An attempt is made to clarify the assumptions behind different models and relate different results which have been obtained.},
